# Where RSVPs are stored. Copy to .env and fill in.
#   local  – saved in the visitor's browser (default, for previews only)
#   sheets – a Google Sheet through Apps Script (free) → see packages/rsvp/README.md
#   rest   – any server implementing the REST contract, e.g. packages/rsvp/backend/node
VITE_RSVP_MODE=local

# VITE_RSVP_SHEETS_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXX/exec
# VITE_RSVP_API_URL=http://localhost:8787/api/rose-garden
